       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.        TFRTSTAT.
       AUTHOR.            DAVE PLUM.
       DATE-WRITTEN.      JUNE 1993.
      *INSTALLATION.      THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY.
      *D************************************************************************
      *D REMARKS.          THIS PROGRAM PRODUCES A FREIGHT STATUS REPORT
      *D                   USING DATA PRIMARILY OBTAINED FROM THE DATASET
      *D                   DAPPLFRT (MCFPCA1100).  THE REPORT IS SORTED BY
      *D                   FREIGHT CARRIER CODE, AND BY THE CARRIER'S FREIGHT
      *D                   BILL NUMBER (PRO NUMBER) WITHIN CARRIER.
      *D************************************************************************
      *C CHANGES.
      *C
      *C 05OCT1993        DAVE PLUM
      *C MADE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES:
      *C    1) REVISED THE PROGRAM TO RELY ON THE FIELDS:
      *C          - MACCT-FRT-FIRST-DATE-PROCESSED
      *C          - MACCT-FRT-FIRST-TIME-PROCESSED
      *C          - MACCT-FRT-LAST-DATE-PROCESSED
      *C          - MACCT-FRT-LAST-TIME-PROCESSED
      *C       FROM KEY=FRT OF MACCOUNT-INFO.
      *C       INSTEAD OF THE PREVIOUS (PREV) AND NEXT MONTH-END DATE AND
      *C       TIME FIELDS FROM KEY=MTED, TO DETERMINE WHAT TIME PERIOD IS
      *C       TO BE INCLUDED IN THE "CURRENT MONTH".
      *C    2) ADDED THE GRAND TOTAL OF ALL "FRT" ENTRIES FOUND IN THE
      *C       DTRANS DATASET TO THE END OF THIS REPORT (THIS IS EFFECTIVELY
      *C       THE SAME AS THE CSAS TRANSACTIONS REPORT, TCSASTRN, SELECTING
      *C       ONLY "FRT" RECORDS.)  THIS VALUE IS THEN ALSO COMPARED TO THE
      *C       TOTAL DOLLARS APPLIED FOR THE CURRENT MONTH, AND A MESSAGE IS
      *C       PRINTED INDICATING WHETHER OR NOT THESE TWO VALUES ARE IN
      *C       BALANCE (THEY ALWAYS SHOULD BE).
      *C    3) REVISED THE REPORT HEADINGS TO INCLUDE:
      *C          - THE NAME OF THE CURRENT ACCOUNTING MONTH ABOVE THE
      *C            HEADING "APPLIED AMOUNT".
      *C          - THE SEQUENCE NUMBER OF THE LAST TIS FILE PROCESSED INTO
      *C            CSAS.
      *C
      *C OCT 29, 1993     CR KALMAN
      *C CHANGED THE DESCRIPTION OF "**MANUAL**" TO "  *MANUAL*" SO IT
      *C WILL BE INDENTED AND THEREFORE, EASIER TO IDENTIFY. REQUESTED
      *C BY GADSDEN.
      *C
      *C 10FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C   ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
DP9404*C 11APR1994    DAVE PLUM      REQUEST #6492
DP9404*C   REVISED THE PROGRAM TO PLACE " **** " IN THE TIS PAID DATE
DP9404*C   COLUMN FOR THOSE FREIGHT BILLS WHICH THE USER HAS UPDATED TO
DP9404*C   HAVE PAID AMOUNT = $0.  THESE FREIGHT BILLS CAN BE IDENTIFIED
DP9404*C   BY THE PRESENCE OF A PAID APPLIED DATE GREATER THAN SPACES
DP9404*C   AND A TIS PAID DATE OF SPACES.
DP9404*C
CY9511*C 01NOV1995    CA YODER
CY9511*C   IF NO RECORDS FOUND IN DAPPLFRT, A MESSAGE WILL NOW PRINT OUT
CY9511*C   ON THE FREIGHT STATUS REPORT INSTEAD OF BLOWING UP.
CY9511*C
CY9606*C 19JUN1996    CA YODER
CY9606*C   MODIFIED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C 30OCT2001    CA YODER
      *C   INCREASED RATED AND PAID AMOUNT FIELD SIZE TO 7 PLACES BEFORE
      *C   DECIMAL POINT.  DANVILLE HAD RECORDS FOR $4M, WHICH WAS NOT
      *C   DISPLAYING ON THE REPORT.
      *C
      **********************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.      C01 IS NEW-PAGE.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT ONLINE-PRT     ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
           SELECT SORT-FILE      ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.

           SELECT CARRIER-FILE
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCACARR
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
              ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

            SELECT DAPPLFRT
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA1101
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
              ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

            SELECT MACCOUNT
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0101
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
              ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

            SELECT DTRANS
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0701
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
              ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  ONLINE-PRT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-REC.
       01  PRINT-REC                    PIC X(132).

       SD  SORT-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 121 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS SORT-REC.
       01  SORT-REC.
           05  SORT-CARRIER             PIC X(4).
           05  SORT-PRO-NO              PIC X(16).
           05  FILLER                   PIC X(101).

       FD  CARRIER-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  CARRIER-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCACARR  OF MCFLCACARR.

       FD  DAPPLFRT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DAPPLFRT-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA1100  OF MCFLCA1101.

       FD  MACCOUNT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MACCOUNT-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0100  OF MCFLCA0101.

       FD  DTRANS
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DTRANS-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0700  OF MCFLCA0701.

      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *  W O R K I N G   -   S T O R A G E   S E C T I O N             *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01  COUNTERS              COMP-3.
           05  LINE-COUNT              PIC S9(3) VALUE 0.
           05  PAGE-COUNT              PIC S9(3) VALUE 0.
           05  CNTL-RECS-TO-SORT       PIC S9(7) VALUE 0.
           05  CNTL-RECS-FROM-SORT     PIC S9(7) VALUE 0.
           05  CNTL-DAPPLFRT-RECS-READ PIC S9(7) VALUE 0.
           05  CNTL-DTRANS-RECS-READ   PIC S9(7) VALUE 0.

       01  DISPLAY-FIELDS.
           05  DISPLAY-COUNT       PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9-          VALUE ZEROES.
           05  DISPLAY-AMOUNT      PIC ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99- VALUE ZEROES.

       01  FLAGS.
           05  EOF-DAPPLFRT-FILE       PIC X(1) VALUE "N".
           05  EOF-SORT-FILE           PIC X(1) VALUE "N".
           05  EOF-DTRANS-FILE         PIC X(1) VALUE "N".

       01  SAVE-CARRIER                PIC X(4) VALUE SPACES.

       01  SAVE-CURR-DATE.
           05  SAVE-CURR-DATE-CC                  PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-CURR-DATE-YYMMDD.
               10 SAVE-CURR-DATE-YY               PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10 SAVE-CURR-DATE-MM               PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10 SAVE-CURR-DATE-DD               PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.

       01  SAVE-ACCTG-MONTH-YEAR.
           05  SAVE-ACCTG-MONTH                   PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-ACCTG-CC                      PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-ACCTG-YEAR                    PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.

       01  SAVE-FIRST-DATE-TIME.
           05  SAVE-FIRST-DATE.
               10  SAVE-FIRST-DATE-CC             PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10  SAVE-FIRST-DATE-YY             PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10  SAVE-FIRST-DATE-MM             PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10  SAVE-FIRST-DATE-DD             PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-FIRST-TIME.
               10  SAVE-FIRST-TIME-HH             PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10  SAVE-FIRST-TIME-MM             PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10  SAVE-FIRST-TIME-SS             PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.

       01  SAVE-LAST-DATE-TIME.
           05  SAVE-LAST-DATE.
               10  SAVE-LAST-DATE-CC              PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10  SAVE-LAST-DATE-YY              PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10  SAVE-LAST-DATE-MM              PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10  SAVE-LAST-DATE-DD              PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-LAST-TIME.
               10  SAVE-LAST-TIME-HH              PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10  SAVE-LAST-TIME-MM              PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
               10  SAVE-LAST-TIME-SS              PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.

       COPY MONTHS OF COPYLIB.

       01  MONTH-SUB                              PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.

       01  WS-TOTALS             COMP-3.
           05  WS-TOT-RATED-AMT        PIC S9(13)V9(2) VALUE 0.
           05  WS-TOT-TAX              PIC S9(13)V9(2) VALUE 0.
           05  WS-TOT-PAID-AMT         PIC S9(13)V9(2) VALUE 0.
           05  WS-TOT-APPLIED-AMT      PIC S9(13)V9(2) VALUE 0.
           05  FIN-TOT-RATED-AMT       PIC S9(13)V9(2) VALUE 0.
           05  FIN-TOT-TAX             PIC S9(13)V9(2) VALUE 0.
           05  FIN-TOT-PAID-AMT        PIC S9(13)V9(2) VALUE 0.
           05  FIN-TOT-APPLIED-AMT     PIC S9(13)V9(2) VALUE 0.
           05  DTRANS-TOT-APPLIED-AMT  PIC S9(13)V9(2) VALUE 0.

