           05  WS-S-PAID-AMT            PIC S9(12)V9(2) VALUE 0.
           05  WS-S-PAID-DATE           PIC X(6)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-S-APPLIED-AMT         PIC S9(12)V9(2) VALUE 0.
